introText:{"type":"field","size":[210,132],"pos":[201,203],"locked":1,"pattern":44,"show":"transparent","border":0,"value":{"text":["Anyone (even you!) can extend Decker by creating reusable ","contraptions",".\n\nIn this lesson, we'll look at the logic behind  ","gridSelector",", a handy contraption for drawing clickable grids.\n\nThe logic is only a few lines of arithmetic, but whenever we find ourselves using the same logic repeatedly, it's worth taking the time to bundle it into a contraption, which you can then ","copy and paste into any deck","!"],"font":["","","","","","",""],"arg":["","","","","","",""],"pat":[1,0,1,0,1,0,1]}}
